  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Securing the right to education for crisis-affected girls and boys in</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will support the implementation of the General Education 5 Year Plan for Lebanon. It will be achieved through the following components: a) Crisis-affected girls and boys in formal and non-formal education are provided with flexible access, and relevant, gender-responsive blended learning; b) Supporting quality of teaching and learning languages; c) Modelling scenarios undertaken to outline the scale of demand in shaping future investments within and beyond the MYRP and within the Lebanese government for medium-term planning of formal and non-formal education.</narrative>
  </description>
